// The Event Log message table of openvibes-agent.exe (#129): one "%1"
// message per level, with the ids winlog2 0.3.2 reports (0xC0000001 error,
// 0x80000002 warning, 0x40000003 info, ...). MSG00409.bin and
// eventmsgs.mc are winlog2's (MIT), compiled by windmc; winlog2 links them
// into its own library only, which never reaches the exe, so build.rs
// links them here. The MSI points EventMessageFile at the exe.
LANGUAGE 0x9, 0x1
1 MESSAGETABLE "MSG00409.bin"
